{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00', 'title': 'WELLS FARGO & COMPANY NAMES CHARLES W. SCHARF AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND PRESIDENT, EFFECTIVE OCTOBER 21, 2019', 'text': 'THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS NAMED CHARLES W. SCHARF AS THE COMPANY’S CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND PRESIDENT, AND A MEMBER OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE OCTOBER 21, 2019. SCHARF WAS CHAIRMAN AND CEO OF BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON. IN MARCH, THE BOARD APPOINTED C. ALLEN PARKER INTERIM CEO AND PRESIDENT AND A MEMBER OF THE BOARD. PARKER WILL CONTINUE TO SERVE IN THESE ROLES UNTIL SCHARF JOINS THE COMPANY; PARKER WILL THEREAFTER SUPPORT THE TRANSITION AS A KEY MEMBER OF THE COMPANY’S LEADERSHIP TEAM AND GENERAL COUNSEL.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00', 'title': 'WELLS FARGO & COMPANY NAMES CHARLES W. SCHARF AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND PRESIDENT, EFFECTIVE OCTOBER 21, 2019', 'text': 'THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS NAMED CHARLES W. SCHARF AS THE COMPANY’S CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND PRESIDENT, AND A MEMBER OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE OCTOBER 21, 2019. SCHARF WAS CHAIRMAN AND CEO OF BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON. IN MARCH, THE BOARD APPOINTED C. ALLEN PARKER INTERIM CEO AND PRESIDENT AND A MEMBER OF THE BOARD. PARKER WILL CONTINUE TO SERVE IN THESE ROLES UNTIL SCHARF JOINS THE COMPANY; PARKER WILL THEREAFTER SUPPORT THE TRANSITION AS A KEY MEMBER OF THE COMPANY’S LEADERSHIP TEAM AND GENERAL COUNSEL.'}{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2019-09-26 22:30:00', 'title': 'WELLS FARGO & COMPANY NAMES CHARLES W. SCHARF AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND PRESIDENT, EFFECTIVE OCTOBER 21, 2019', 'text': 'THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS NAMED CHARLES W. SCHARF AS THE COMPANY’S CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND PRESIDENT, AND A MEMBER OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE OCTOBER 21, 2019. SCHARF WAS CHAIRMAN AND CEO OF BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON. IN MARCH, THE BOARD APPOINTED C. ALLE